// "Scry(who)" ([CR#701.22a]) — the bare-verb pattern TWIN: "whenever `who`
// scries". Expands to the `Act` master form, the performer riding `who` (the
// fact's `actor`). A reorder verb carries no zone-move shape, so the
// Replacement lane matches on name like the trigger lane.
(
    name: "Scry",
    template: "${0} scries",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: Act(verb: Scry, who: Param(0)),
)
